    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_27",
      "hash64": "29BC1105FA6FF905",
      "text": "哦？[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳搞定了嘛。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
