      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_30",
      "hash64": "29BF9005FA7306A9",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳表現這麼穩定，\\n我就慷慨大放送了！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_31",
      "hash64": "29BF8F05FA7304F6",
      "text": "這個也順便送給[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳。\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要是能搭配好，和我就是死黨裝了。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
