          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_23",
      "hash64": "29BC0D05FA6FF239",
      "text": "我走囉～[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_13",
      "hash64": "CA03202959AD89C7",
      "text": "真是的～！那傢伙！\\n他到底怎麼回事！！[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_14",
      "hash64": "CA031D2959AD84AE",
      "text": "而且還說什麼約會……\\n啥？約會是什麼意思！？[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_select_03",
      "hash64": "BB9D8812C0B5CCFE",
      "text": "冷靜一點",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_select_04",
      "hash64": "BB9D8B12C0B5D217",
      "text": "所謂的約會就是……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_15",
      "hash64": "CA031E2959AD8661",
      "text": "我先把話說清楚，\\n我可不是對約會這回事在激動。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_16",
      "hash64": "CA031B2959AD8148",
      "text": "喂，我當然知道意思！\\n我說[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳……意外地挺早熟的！？[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_17",
      "hash64": "CA031C2959AD82FB",
      "text": "……抱歉，果然在這裡\\n我還是不太自在。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_18",
      "hash64": "CA03192959AD7DE2",
      "text": "我們換個地方吧。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_sister_19",
      "hash64": "CA031A2959AD7F95",
      "text": "找個誰都不會來的地方……\\n我們去[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的房間吧。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
